        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai epei a ŋisubuna a ŋulu erimokinito Ekapolon kidiŋ toporu neni ayai ayoŋ etiŋit atotole ŋina anepi ŋina keriŋa elemunio anamuroet a aridet a ŋatotol. ",
          "type": "text",
